<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Plano de Trabalho — Reformulação SIM/Atende</title>
<style>
:root{
  --navy:#003876;--navy-2:#003876;--navy-ink:#003876;--grey:#9CAFB8;--grey-l:#dfe6ea;--grey-xl:#f2f5f7;
  --ink:#1c2a36;--muted:#5d6f7b;--line:#d5dde2;--bg:#f6f8fa;--card:#ffffff;
  --ok:#1f7a4d;--ok-bg:#e3f3ea;--wip:#003876;--wip-bg:#e0e8f1;--todo:#7a8790;--todo-bg:#eef1f3;--late:#b3261e;--late-bg:#fbe7e5;
  box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){
  --ink:#e4ebf0;--muted:#9fb1bc;--line:#2c3c4a;--bg:#0f1820;--card:#16222d;--grey-xl:#1b2935;--grey-l:#2a3a48;
  --ok-bg:#163829;--wip-bg:#15304f;--todo-bg:#22303c;--late-bg:#3f1d1b;--ok:#5fcf95;--wip:#8fb6e3;--late:#f08a82;--todo:#9fb1bc;}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{color-scheme:dark;--ink:#e4ebf0;--muted:#9fb1bc;--line:#2c3c4a;--bg:#0f1820;--card:#16222d;--grey-xl:#1b2935;--grey-l:#2a3a48;
  --ok-bg:#163829;--wip-bg:#15304f;--todo-bg:#22303c;--late-bg:#3f1d1b;--ok:#5fcf95;--wip:#8fb6e3;--late:#f08a82;--todo:#9fb1bc;}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:"Segoe UI",Calibri,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5}
.wrap{max-width:1680px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px 64px}
header.top{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
header.top .wrap{max-width:none;padding-left:28px;padding-right:28px;padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:30px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:32px;align-items:end}
.org{font-size:13px;color:#c9d6de;margin:0 0 10px}
h1{font-size:34px;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.lead{max-width:820px;margin:0;color:#dbe5eb;font-size:16px}
.gauge{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:10px;padding:16px 20px;min-width:300px}
.gauge svg{flex:none}
.gauge b{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#fff}
.gauge span{font-size:13px;color:#c9d6de}
.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:260px minmax(0,1fr);transition:grid-template-columns .2s ease;min-height:calc(100vh - 170px)}
.side{background:var(--navy);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);position:sticky;top:0;align-self:start;height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:20px 12px;padding-top:calc(20px + env(safe-area-inset-top,0px))}
.side nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
.side a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;color:#c9d6de;text-decoration:none;padding:11px 14px;border-radius:6px;font-size:14.5px;border-left:3px solid transparent}
.side a svg{width:20px;height:20px;flex:none;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.side a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#fff}
.side a[aria-current="page"]{background:rgba(156,175,184,.18);color:#fff;border-left-color:var(--grey);font-weight:600}
.side-tg{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:100%;background:none;border:0;color:#9fb4c2;padding:8px 14px;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;border-radius:6px}
.side-tg:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#fff}
.side-tg svg{width:20px;height:20px;flex:none;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;transition:transform .2s}
.side span{line-height:1.3}
body.side-min .layout{grid-template-columns:72px minmax(0,1fr)}
body.side-min .side{padding-left:10px;padding-right:10px}
body.side-min .side a,body.side-min .side-tg{justify-content:center;padding-left:0;padding-right:0}
body.side-min .side a span,body.side-min .side-tg span{display:none}
body.side-min .side-tg svg{transform:rotate(180deg)}
body.side-min .side-foot .themebtn{font-size:0;padding:8px 0;min-height:34px}
body.side-min .side-foot .themebtn::before{content:"◐";font-size:20px;line-height:1}
.side-foot{margin-top:auto;padding:12px 4px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
.side-foot .themebtn{width:100%}
.content{padding:0 36px 48px;min-width:0}
.content>section{display:none;animation:secIn .18s ease-out}
.content>section.active{display:block}
@keyframes secIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}
section{margin-top:30px}
h2{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 4px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px;max-width:900px}
.grid{display:grid;gap:16px}
.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.g2{grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr}
.panel{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:20px 22px}
.panel h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600}
.panel p{margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--muted)}
ul.clean{margin:0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)}ul.clean li{margin:4px 0}
/* método */
.flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--card)}
.step{padding:18px 18px 20px;border-left:1px solid var(--line);position:relative}
.step:first-child{border-left:0}
.step .n{display:inline-flex;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:10px}
.step h4{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:15px}
.step p{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.step .w{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--navy-2);font-weight:600}
:root[data-theme="dark"] .step .w{color:var(--grey)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .step .w{color:var(--grey)}}
.step .gate{font-size:12.5px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);padding-top:8px;color:var(--ink)}
/* KPIs */
.kpi{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:18px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.kpi .v{font-size:30px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;color:var(--navy)}
:root[data-theme="dark"] .kpi .v{color:#8fb6e3}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .kpi .v{color:#8fb6e3}}
.kpi .l{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
.kpi .d{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.kpi .bar{height:6px;background:var(--grey-l);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden}
.kpi .bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--navy)}
.kpi.alert{border-left:4px solid var(--late)}
table.ind{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:var(--card);font-size:14px}
table.ind th,table.ind td{text-align:left;padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}
table.ind th{background:var(--grey-xl);font-weight:600;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
table.ind td:first-child{font-weight:600}
.tw{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}
.tag{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--grey-xl);color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}
/* ondas */
.waves{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.wave{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:4px solid var(--navy);border-radius:8px;padding:18px 20px}
.wave:nth-child(2){border-top-color:var(--navy-2)}.wave:nth-child(3){border-top-color:var(--grey)}
.wave h3{margin:0;font-size:16px}.wave .when{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:2px 0 10px}
/* toolbar */
.toolbar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin:0 0 14px}
.toolbar input[type=search],.toolbar select{font:inherit;font-size:14px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:var(--card);color:var(--ink)}
.toolbar input[type=search]{min-width:260px;flex:1;max-width:420px}
button{font:inherit;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);padding:8px 14px}
button:hover{border-color:var(--grey)}
button.primary{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-color:var(--navy)}
button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #6aa3e0;outline-offset:2px}
.spacer{flex:1}
.legend{display:flex;gap:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);flex-wrap:wrap}
.legend span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;display:inline-block}
/* áreas */
.area{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:12px;overflow:hidden}
.area-h{display:grid;grid-template-columns:24px minmax(130px,1fr) minmax(150px,1.4fr) repeat(5,minmax(0,.6fr)) 60px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:16px 20px;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;width:100%;text-align:left;border:0;border-radius:0;background:none}
.area-h:hover{background:var(--grey-xl)}
.chev{width:22px;height:22px;transition:transform .2s;color:var(--navy)}
.area.open .chev{transform:rotate(90deg)}
.area-h .nm{font-size:17px;font-weight:600}
.area-h .nm small{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)}
.stack{display:flex;height:12px;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--grey-l)}
.stack i{display:block;height:100%}
.stack-l{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px}
.mini{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.25}
.mini b{display:block;font-size:17px;color:var(--ink)}
.pct{font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);text-align:right}
:root[data-theme="dark"] .pct{color:#8fb6e3}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .pct{color:#8fb6e3}}
.area-b{display:none;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.area.open .area-b{display:block}
table.proc{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13.5px;min-width:1500px}
table.proc th{position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--grey-xl);text-align:left;font-weight:600;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);white-space:nowrap}
table.proc td{padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:middle}
table.proc tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
table.proc tr:hover td{background:var(--grey-xl)}
td.pn{font-weight:500;min-width:280px}
td input{font:inherit;font-size:13px;border:1px solid transparent;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);padding:4px 6px;border-radius:4px;width:100%}
td input:hover{border-color:var(--line)}td input:focus{border-color:var(--navy);background:var(--card)}
td input[type=number]{width:58px}td input[type=date]{width:136px}
td.fo input{min-width:120px}
.chips{display:flex;gap:4px}
.chip{width:26px;flex:none;height:24px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid var(--line);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0;background:var(--todo-bg);color:var(--todo)}
.chip[data-s="1"]{background:var(--wip-bg);color:var(--wip);border-color:transparent}
.chip[data-s="2"]{background:var(--ok);color:#fff;border-color:transparent}
.badge{display:inline-block;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}
.b-ok{background:var(--ok-bg);color:var(--ok)}.b-wip{background:var(--wip-bg);color:var(--wip)}.b-todo{background:var(--todo-bg);color:var(--todo)}.b-late{background:var(--late-bg);color:var(--late)}
.pbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-width:96px}
.pbar .t{flex:1;height:6px;background:var(--grey-l);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden}
.pbar .t i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--navy)}
.pbar span{font-size:12.5px;width:34px;text-align:right;color:var(--muted)}
.env{white-space:nowrap}
.env.late{color:var(--late);font-weight:600}
.yn{font-size:12.5px}
.empty{padding:22px;color:var(--muted)}
/* alinhamentos */
.waves{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr))!important}
.wave:nth-child(3n+2){border-top-color:var(--navy-2)}.wave:nth-child(3n){border-top-color:var(--grey)}
.wv-top{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:flex-start}
.ed{font:inherit;color:var(--ink);background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 6px;width:100%;resize:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1.4}
.ed:hover{border-color:var(--line)}.ed:focus{border-color:var(--navy);background:var(--card);outline:none}
.ed.h{font-size:16px;font-weight:600}.ed.m{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.wave ul.pp{margin:8px 0 10px;padding-left:18px}
.wave-new{border:2px dashed var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);min-height:160px;font-size:14px}
.wave-new:hover{border-color:var(--navy);color:var(--ink)}
.rit{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr))!important}
.rit .panel{padding:14px 16px}
.rit-new{border:2px dashed var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);min-height:120px}
.rit-new:hover{border-color:var(--navy);color:var(--ink)}
.sec-h{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
#printView{display:none}
@page{size:A4;margin:14mm}
.pv{font-family:"Segoe UI",Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1c2a36;font-size:12px;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact}
.pv-h{background:#003876;color:#fff;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:6px;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center}
.pv-h img{height:48px}.pv-h h1{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 2px}.pv-h p{margin:0;font-size:11.5px;color:#dbe5eb}
.pv h2{font-size:14px;color:#003876;margin:18px 0 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #9CAFB8;padding-bottom:4px}
.pv-rit{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px}
.pv-rit div{border:1px solid #d5dde2;border-left:4px solid #003876;border-radius:4px;padding:8px 10px;break-inside:avoid}
.pv-rit b{display:block;font-size:12.5px}.pv-rit small{display:block;color:#5d6f7b;font-size:11px;margin-bottom:3px}
.pv ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}.pv li{margin:3px 0}
.pv table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.pv th,.pv td{border-bottom:1px solid #d5dde2;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
.pv th{background:#f2f5f7;font-size:11px;color:#5d6f7b}
.pv .foot{margin-top:18px;font-size:10.5px;color:#5d6f7b}
.g2b{grid-template-columns:1fr 1.3fr}
.brand{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center}
.logo{height:72px;width:auto;flex:none}
.themebtn{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);color:#dbe5eb;margin:6px 0;padding:5px 12px;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap}
.themebtn:hover{border-color:#fff;color:#fff}
.pp-h{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px}
.pp-h h3{margin:0}
.ust{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.ust input,.pp input{font:inherit;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink);background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px}
ol.pp,ul.pp{margin:0 0 10px;padding-left:22px;color:var(--muted)}
ol.pp li{margin:4px 0}
.pp .row{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:flex-start}
.pp .tx{font:inherit;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink);border-radius:6px;resize:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1.4;flex:1;border:1px solid transparent;border-color:transparent;background:transparent;padding:5px 6px}
.pp .tx:hover{border-color:var(--line)}.pp .tx:focus{border-color:var(--navy);background:var(--card)}
.pp input.dt{width:140px;font-size:13px}
.del{border:0;background:none;color:var(--muted);padding:4px 8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1}
.del:hover{color:var(--late)}
.add{font-size:13px;padding:6px 12px}
td.stg{white-space:nowrap;padding:6px 6px}
td.stg .cell{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px}
td.stg input{width:52px;padding:3px 4px;text-align:right}
td.stg .u{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
th.stg{text-align:center!important}
.mini small{display:block;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.rit{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px}
.rit .panel h3 small{display:block;font-weight:400;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.att{border-left:4px solid var(--late)}
footer{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:40px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:16px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:space-between}
.toast{position:fixed;bottom:calc(20px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;opacity:0;transition:opacity .2s;pointer-events:none}
.toast.on{opacity:1}
@media (max-width:1200px){.g4,.rit{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.flow{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.step{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .area-h{grid-template-columns:28px 1fr 80px;}.area-h .stackw{grid-column:2/4}.area-h .mini{display:none}}
@media (max-width:900px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.side{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;height:auto;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;padding:6px 8px;overflow-x:auto}
  .side nav{flex-direction:row}.side a{white-space:nowrap;padding:8px 10px;border-left:0;border-bottom:3px solid transparent;border-radius:0}.side a[aria-current="page"]{border-bottom-color:var(--grey);background:none}
  .side-tg{display:none}body.side-min .layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}body.side-min .side a span{display:inline}body.side-min .side a{padding:8px 10px}body.side-min .side-foot .themebtn{font-size:13px;padding:5px 12px}body.side-min .side-foot .themebtn::before{content:none}
  .side-foot{margin:0 0 0 8px;padding:0;border:0}.side-foot .themebtn{width:auto}.content{padding:0 16px 40px}}
@media (max-width:820px){.g2b{grid-template-columns:1fr}.logo{height:52px}.brand{gap:16px}.wrap{padding:0 16px 48px}header.top .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}.g3,.g2,.waves,.g4,.rit,.flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}.step{border-left:0}h1{font-size:27px}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}
@media print{
  body.printing>*:not(#printView){display:none!important}
  body.printing #printView{display:block}
  body.printing{background:#fff!important}
  .side,.toolbar,.toast,#pdfBtn,.del,.add,.wave-new,.rit-new{display:none!important}.area .area-b{display:block}body{background:#fff}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="top"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="brand"><img class="logo" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Martins"><div>
    <p class="org">Martins · Diretoria Geral de Eficiência Operacional · Mapeamento de Processos</p>
    <h1>Plano de trabalho: reformulação do SIM/Atende</h1>
    <p class="lead">Mapear os processos das áreas de negócio e desenhar o modelo de parametrização de cada um no SIM/Atende, para que as solicitações entrem por um canal único, com fluxo, aprovação e SLA definidos.</p>
  </div></div>
  <div class="gauge" aria-live="polite">
    <svg width="74" height="74" viewBox="0 0 74 74" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="37" cy="37" r="31" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.18)" stroke-width="8"/><circle id="gArc" cx="37" cy="37" r="31" fill="none" stroke="#9CAFB8" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="0 195" transform="rotate(-90 37 37)"/><text id="gTxt" x="37" y="42" text-anchor="middle" font-size="16" font-weight="600" fill="#fff">0%</text></svg>
    <div><b>Evolução geral da frente</b><span id="gSub"></span><span id="gUpd" style="display:block"></span></div>
  </div>
</div></header>
<div class="layout">
<aside class="side" aria-label="Seções do plano">
